
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Library Membership | Knowledge Hub Library</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7fb;
            color: #263238;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #123b5d;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #082b45;
            padding: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffc857;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #164e75, #287e9e);
            color: white;
            padding: 45px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .membership-info {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #00000012;
        }

        .membership-info h2 {
            color: #123b5d;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .membership-info ul {
            padding-left: 22px;
        }

        .form-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #00000015;
        }

        .form-box h2 {
            color: #123b5d;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        input, select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-top: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #ccd5df;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
            outline: 2px solid #287e9e;
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            background: #123b5d;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px;
            margin-top: 22px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #287e9e;
        }

        footer {
            background: #082b45;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #ffc857;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 12px;
            }
        }
    </style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>📚 KNOWLEDGE HUB LIBRARY</h1>
    <p>Read, Learn and Grow</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="membership.html">Membership</a>
    <a href="book-request.html">Book Request</a>
    <a href="feedback.html">Feedback</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>Become a Library Member</h2>
    <p>Join our learning community and explore a world of knowledge.</p>
</section>

<main class="container">

    <section class="membership-info">
        <h2>Why Join Knowledge Hub Library?</h2>

        <p>
            Knowledge Hub Library welcomes students, teachers
            and community members who wish to develop their
            reading, research and digital learning skills.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Access to educational reading materials.</li>
            <li>Support for academic research.</li>
            <li>Opportunities to improve digital literacy.</li>
            <li>Access to library learning activities.</li>
            <li>Promotion of lifelong learning.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="form-box">
        <h2>Membership Registration Form</h2>

        <form action="#" method="post">

            <label for="fullname">Full Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="fullname"
                name="fullname"
                placeholder="Enter your full name" required>

            <label for="email">Email Address</label>
            <input type="email" id="email"
                name="email"
                placeholder="Enter your email address" required>

            <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone"
                name="phone"
                placeholder="Enter your phone number" required>

            <label for="gender">Gender (Optional)</label>
            <select id="gender" name="gender">
                <option value="">Select an option</option>
                <option>Male</option>
                <option>Female</option>
                <option>Prefer not to say</option>
            </select>

            <label for="category">Membership Category</label>
            <select id="category" name="category" required>
                <option value="">Choose category</option>
                <option>Student</option>
                <option>Teacher</option>
                <option>Researcher</option>
                <option>Community Member</option>
            </select>

            <label for="institution">School / Institution</label>
            <input type="text" id="institution"
                name="institution"
                placeholder="Enter institution name">

            <label for="reason">Why do you want to join?</label>
            <textarea id="reason" name="reason"
                rows="4"
                placeholder="Briefly describe your interest"></textarea>

            <button type="submit">
                Submit Membership Application
            </button>

        </form>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Knowledge Hub Library. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    <p>Read • Learn • Research • Grow</p>
    <p><a href="index.html">Return to Home</a></p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
